<FeatureFacts id="sync" />

With Pro, sign in on each device and LogIt keeps them the same: workouts, splits, exercises, habits,
goals, food lists and settings. Changes made offline sync when you're back online. If the same split
was changed on two devices, you're asked which one to keep.

## Coached

<FeatureFacts id="coached-sync" />

Your coach only ever sees what you share with them. See [Having a coach](/docs/having-a-coach).
